WEBVTT

01:28.865 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.705 --> 01:35.705
She doesn't remember anything.

01:36.945 --> 01:38.385
She doesn't remember Li Hongqing.

01:39.745 --> 01:40.865
Like this,

01:42.465 --> 01:45.025
do you really think she'll ever be happy?

01:55.385 --> 01:56.305
Qianqing…

01:57.665 --> 01:59.145
I remember now.

02:02.065 --> 02:04.305
I wanted to go with you…

02:05.785 --> 02:07.225
outside the palace.

02:27.665 --> 02:29.225
We must never let Xiao Ying remember!

02:31.345 --> 02:33.905
Madam, Xiao Ying has never seen you.

02:34.705 --> 02:35.745
No.

02:36.785 --> 02:38.345
No…

02:38.425 --> 02:39.385
He's so smart.

02:39.985 --> 02:42.665
He's bound to pick up
on some clue about me.

02:45.065 --> 02:46.705
We can't let Xiao Ying live.

02:47.225 --> 02:48.745
She has to die!

02:48.825 --> 02:50.265
Rest easy, Madam.

02:51.385 --> 02:52.465
She may not make it through.

02:57.785 --> 02:59.505
Xiao Ying couldn't kill him.

03:00.105 --> 03:01.825
Ling Xuefeng couldn't kill him.

03:02.985 --> 03:05.145
Why does he always slip away?

03:07.585 --> 03:09.465
Looks like I'll have to do it myself.

03:13.025 --> 03:14.785
Ever since he seized that little witch,

03:15.305 --> 03:17.785
Qianqing hasn't set
foot in Xuanguang Hall.

03:18.785 --> 03:21.425
This son of mine would toss me aside

03:21.505 --> 03:23.265
for some lowborn woman!

03:23.345 --> 03:25.065
His Highness must
be busy with state affairs.

03:25.145 --> 03:26.865
Busy with what?

03:26.945 --> 03:30.025
If he spared even half
a thought for proper duties,

03:30.105 --> 03:32.025
I wouldn't have to worry like this.

03:42.305 --> 03:44.145
These flowers need trimming.

03:45.425 --> 03:46.865
You are right, Your Majesty.

03:53.705 --> 03:54.745
Greetings, Your Majesty.

04:00.145 --> 04:02.545
This is Rest Incense I've prepared myself.

04:03.905 --> 04:05.785
Your Majesty may
find it useful these days.

04:07.825 --> 04:10.465
You've personally made incense for me?

04:11.865 --> 04:13.105
If I remember right,

04:13.185 --> 04:14.985
this is the first time in five years.

04:17.745 --> 04:19.265
I was disrespectful before.

04:20.265 --> 04:21.504
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

04:21.585 --> 04:22.985
REST INCENSE

04:23.825 --> 04:25.025
Don't say that.

04:25.625 --> 04:28.265
Everyone in this palace knows

04:28.345 --> 04:30.225
you are His Majesty's man

04:30.745 --> 04:32.625
and that you are wary of Xuanguang Hall,

04:32.705 --> 04:34.425
so you keep your distance.

04:34.505 --> 04:35.625
I understand.

04:38.665 --> 04:42.305
Prince of Yuzhang's loyalty to His Majesty
far surpasses mine.

04:42.825 --> 04:44.305
I was narrow-minded before.

04:45.465 --> 04:47.785
Preceptor Du, why would you say that?

04:49.225 --> 04:51.225
His Highness has given
his all to assist His Majesty.

04:51.745 --> 04:54.065
Now Great Qi stands secure,

04:54.585 --> 04:56.345
and His Majesty
holds power firmly in hand.

04:56.425 --> 04:58.105
Yet His Highness
chose to withdraw at his peak,

04:58.185 --> 05:01.105
indifferent to rank and reward,
a true example to the realm.

05:02.105 --> 05:05.265
All of this
is thanks to Your Majesty's kindness

05:05.785 --> 05:06.785
and wise guidance.

05:10.985 --> 05:12.545
You may speak freely.

05:13.265 --> 05:16.385
About His Highness stepping back,
what exactly did he do?

05:19.265 --> 05:20.745
So Your Majesty truly didn't know?

05:23.185 --> 05:25.665
Then I've overstepped
by speaking out of turn.

05:30.745 --> 05:32.265
His Highness is so upright and selfless

05:32.785 --> 05:34.745
that he's given both his royal seal
and his command token to His Majesty.

05:35.665 --> 05:38.105
His loyalty is pure enough.

05:38.705 --> 05:41.385
I'm ashamed by comparison.

05:42.625 --> 05:43.545
I shall take my leave.

06:03.625 --> 06:06.025
Ask Qianqing to see me! At once!

06:06.105 --> 06:07.025
Yes, Your Majesty.

06:10.705 --> 06:11.745
So,

06:12.345 --> 06:17.265
you handed over your royal seal
and your command token just like that?

06:19.745 --> 06:21.825
You decided this on your own

06:23.185 --> 06:26.345
and couldn't even be bothered to tell me?

06:27.265 --> 06:28.905
Of course you would object.

06:29.865 --> 06:31.545
But I've already thought it through.

06:36.185 --> 06:37.705
As a prince,

06:38.305 --> 06:40.265
you feel nothing for the throne.

06:41.385 --> 06:44.825
And now, you've even handed over

06:45.425 --> 06:46.745
your command token and seal?

06:47.345 --> 06:49.105
If I don't lay these burdens down,

06:49.785 --> 06:52.745
where else can I ever find true freedom?

06:53.985 --> 06:55.105
Qianqing…

06:56.785 --> 06:58.545
how many times have I told you?

06:58.625 --> 07:02.905
Your brother, Xiao Huan,
is extremely calculating.

07:03.665 --> 07:05.345
If you hand these over today,

07:05.425 --> 07:08.185
tomorrow could be the day we die!

07:11.145 --> 07:12.225
I've already made up my mind.

07:13.745 --> 07:16.665
Beat me or punish me, whatever you wish.

07:18.545 --> 07:20.345
You ungrateful son!

07:20.425 --> 07:23.185
Do you know what it has
cost me to live to this day?

07:29.385 --> 07:30.505
The late Emperor

07:31.345 --> 07:34.265
lavished all his affection on
that shady woman of unknown origin.

07:34.345 --> 07:36.665
He even made her empress.

07:37.545 --> 07:38.745
When she died,

07:38.825 --> 07:41.825
he made her sickly son crown prince.

07:42.945 --> 07:46.425
Our Liu clan has served
loyally for three generations,

07:47.145 --> 07:48.345
a house of high rank.

07:48.425 --> 07:50.025
How am I any worse than her?

07:50.825 --> 07:51.945
And you,

07:52.025 --> 07:54.425
how are you any
worse than that sickly wretch?

07:54.945 --> 07:56.625
What has gotten into you all?

07:56.705 --> 07:58.185
Have you all gone mad?

08:00.425 --> 08:01.625
Qianqing,

08:03.225 --> 08:05.665
Xiao Huan is not your brother.

08:06.825 --> 08:09.105
He's someone who could
take your life at any moment,

08:09.625 --> 08:10.905
your enemy!

08:13.625 --> 08:15.705
In all the prices you've paid,

08:18.105 --> 08:19.145
does that include Ying?

08:24.025 --> 08:26.025
You… You're talking nonsense again.

08:26.625 --> 08:28.665
Deep down, we both know

08:28.745 --> 08:33.225
what really happened with that fire
at Luling Palace!

08:33.305 --> 08:34.585
You were so harsh on my imperial brother

08:34.664 --> 08:35.625
that the palace servants
dared to abandon their posts,

08:35.705 --> 08:36.625
and that led to the fire.

08:36.705 --> 08:39.185
If not for you,
Ying would never have ended up like this!

08:39.264 --> 08:40.664
How dare you!

08:40.745 --> 08:44.105
Why did the late empress
suddenly die of a mysterious illness?

08:45.385 --> 08:48.545
Why was her son born with cold poison?

08:49.145 --> 08:50.265
Mother,

08:50.785 --> 08:54.385
do you dare look into these things?

08:59.985 --> 09:02.425
There is a limit to
this kind of wild talk!

09:06.585 --> 09:07.585
Mother,

09:09.665 --> 09:10.865
do you love Ying?

09:16.185 --> 09:17.545
And have you ever loved me?

09:18.905 --> 09:22.105
Do you think everything I've done
was to hurt you?

09:28.265 --> 09:29.505
Maybe you did.

09:30.265 --> 09:31.585
But the day comes

09:32.585 --> 09:35.225
when we can no
longer be tools in your battles,

09:36.545 --> 09:37.705
you'll stop loving us, don't you?

09:42.745 --> 09:43.625
You…

09:48.105 --> 09:52.185
Mother, you've spent your whole life
trapped in this palace.

09:53.265 --> 09:54.785
I don't want to repeat your fate.

09:56.745 --> 09:57.945
This palace

09:58.585 --> 10:00.865
is nothing but a gilded cage.

10:04.065 --> 10:06.985
Have you ever truly been happy here?

10:09.105 --> 10:10.385
Ying included.

10:11.345 --> 10:13.345
She was completely innocent,

10:14.265 --> 10:15.905
yet still got dragged in!

10:17.225 --> 10:18.385
I've thought it through.

10:19.025 --> 10:20.305
Once Ying recovers,

10:20.905 --> 10:22.825
I'll take her away from here at once,

10:23.465 --> 10:24.825
back to Southern Chu.

11:22.705 --> 11:24.345
-What's wrong?
-Nothing.

11:26.985 --> 11:29.585
Did you argue with your mother?
She hit you?

11:32.225 --> 11:33.545
News sure travels fast with you.

11:39.065 --> 11:40.065
Zhong Lin…

11:41.385 --> 11:44.945
I'm in a bad mood, and my wound hurts.

11:50.585 --> 11:52.345
When I was little, I got beaten a lot too.

11:52.425 --> 11:54.065
And I was terribly afraid of pain.

11:54.705 --> 11:56.105
After enough beatings,
I eventually got used to it.

11:58.585 --> 12:00.305
This is my own special salve.

12:00.385 --> 12:03.025
It works wonders!
It eases the pain right away.

12:17.065 --> 12:20.105
Zhong Lin, thank you

12:21.265 --> 12:23.945
for staying by my side
when I was at my lowest.

12:36.025 --> 12:37.425
Don't worry.

12:37.505 --> 12:39.265
I've already made up my mind.

12:39.345 --> 12:41.705
I'll take you and Ying away from here.

12:42.305 --> 12:45.425
We'll travel the world together,
free and unrestrained.

12:46.705 --> 12:49.585
Travel the world, free and unrestrained…

12:52.985 --> 12:53.825
All right.

12:54.505 --> 12:55.425
We'll go together!

13:17.345 --> 13:19.585
The Empress Dowager is here!

13:23.265 --> 13:26.505
My dear Ying, what are you doing?

13:30.705 --> 13:33.105
Move aside! You're blocking my sun.

13:35.465 --> 13:39.265
Ying, look at me.

13:40.025 --> 13:41.505
Mother's here to see you.

13:42.945 --> 13:43.865
Mother?

13:44.945 --> 13:46.385
Does "Mother" mean my mom?

13:46.465 --> 13:47.785
Yes.

13:51.945 --> 13:53.145
You look so fierce.

13:53.225 --> 13:55.185
I don't want you as my mother.

13:55.785 --> 13:57.825
I like the fun, pretty Empress.

13:58.625 --> 14:00.545
I want her to be my mother.

14:00.625 --> 14:01.785
My brother likes her too.

14:01.865 --> 14:03.665
She even promised to cure me.

14:04.185 --> 14:06.825
I'll get better soon.

14:07.745 --> 14:09.425
She wants to treat you?

14:09.505 --> 14:11.225
-Hongqing…
-How could she cure anyone?

14:12.505 --> 14:14.265
She definitely doesn't mean well.

14:15.305 --> 14:16.945
You mustn't believe the Empress's lies.

14:22.465 --> 14:26.185
Ying, do me a favor, will you?

14:26.265 --> 14:27.585
Help me talk some sense into your brother.

14:27.665 --> 14:29.385
Tell him to take back his royal seal.

14:29.985 --> 14:30.905
All right?

14:32.865 --> 14:34.225
Are you listening to me?

14:36.385 --> 14:38.545
Help me persuade
your brother to take back his seal.

14:39.065 --> 14:40.065
Do you understand?

14:43.945 --> 14:45.305
Do you or don't you?

14:46.825 --> 14:48.145
Ying, I'm talking to you!

14:48.225 --> 14:50.505
Do you understand? Listen to me!

14:59.185 --> 15:02.505
Xiao Huan, save me!

15:06.865 --> 15:07.825
Ying…

15:12.585 --> 15:15.625
Mother, what did you give Father to drink?

15:20.105 --> 15:21.945
What did you give Father to drink?

15:27.025 --> 15:28.185
What are you talking about?

15:36.385 --> 15:37.385
Ying?

16:02.025 --> 16:03.505
Your Majesty, time to take medicine.

16:16.345 --> 16:17.545
You…

16:27.465 --> 16:29.385
What did you give Father to drink?

16:33.185 --> 16:35.305
Tell me… Ying…

16:35.825 --> 16:36.905
has she remembered everything?

16:38.585 --> 16:40.225
We really can't let her remember.

16:40.305 --> 16:41.905
We can't let her remember!

16:58.225 --> 16:59.145
Li…

16:59.825 --> 17:00.945
Hong…

17:02.025 --> 17:02.985
Qing…

17:09.464 --> 17:10.985
Dear Hongqing…

17:12.944 --> 17:14.424
I remember you now.

18:01.105 --> 18:03.705
Heavens above, you're finally awake!

18:07.265 --> 18:08.505
Where am I?

18:11.065 --> 18:11.905
This is Lujiao Village.

18:12.745 --> 18:14.505
When we went up the mountain to chop wood,

18:14.585 --> 18:15.985
we saw you hanging from a tree.

18:16.065 --> 18:17.065
You were barely breathing.

18:17.825 --> 18:19.425
So the two of us carried you back.

18:20.265 --> 18:22.385
The village physician
said you wouldn't make it.

18:22.985 --> 18:25.545
Didn't expect you to be this hard to kill!

18:26.665 --> 18:28.185
Was I unconscious?

18:29.225 --> 18:30.905
-Yeah.
-How long was I out?

18:33.185 --> 18:34.225
About…

18:34.825 --> 18:36.345
a full fifteen days!

18:36.425 --> 18:37.785
That's right, fifteen days.

18:39.265 --> 18:41.905
Don't get up! Just rest…

18:41.985 --> 18:43.225
You just woke up.

18:43.305 --> 18:45.545
Your body's still too weak.
What are you trying to do?

18:53.785 --> 18:55.785
Please take me to Fenglai Pavilion.

18:56.905 --> 18:58.265
For saving my life,

18:59.425 --> 19:00.625
I'll see that you're well rewarded.

19:49.585 --> 19:51.505
But Li Hongqing is dead.

19:51.585 --> 19:53.465
-Even if the flower blooms…
-Don't say that again!

19:53.545 --> 19:55.425
there's no one left to protect you.

20:01.705 --> 20:02.545
That day…

20:04.345 --> 20:05.625
someone told me…

20:07.385 --> 20:09.145
Hongqing was dead.

20:12.625 --> 20:14.985
No one would take me to see the flowers.

20:23.585 --> 20:25.505
He gave me a box…

20:28.065 --> 20:29.665
Inside was some incense…

20:31.785 --> 20:32.705
Was it Gold Incense?

20:39.665 --> 20:41.385
That scent was so familiar…

20:49.145 --> 20:50.545
What did it smell like?

20:57.625 --> 20:58.665
Medicine…

21:01.545 --> 21:02.825
It was some medicinal incense…

21:23.105 --> 21:24.665
It was some medicinal incense…

21:24.745 --> 21:26.225
Today, when Father
was struck by that arrow,

21:26.825 --> 21:27.945
he uttered some strange word.

21:40.625 --> 21:42.625
NANRONG

21:57.145 --> 21:58.705
Is it really you?

21:59.385 --> 22:00.625
Your Majesty.

22:01.705 --> 22:04.105
It's rare to see you so distracted.
What are you thinking about?

22:09.505 --> 22:12.625
I was thinking that once all this is over,

22:12.705 --> 22:16.305
I want to leave the palace with you
and roam the martial world again.

22:17.265 --> 22:18.505
Sounds good.

22:18.585 --> 22:19.905
Your Majesty's word is law.

22:20.425 --> 22:22.145
Why don't you put it in writing as a vow?

22:23.465 --> 22:24.425
All right.

22:24.945 --> 22:27.625
Then for my empress, I'll write a vow.

22:59.785 --> 23:02.105
BE OUR PROOF

23:20.385 --> 23:22.305
"Cangcang and Chifan's vow:

23:22.905 --> 23:26.105
to cross mountains and rivers,
and roam the martial world together.

23:26.185 --> 23:27.425
This shall be our proof."

23:30.705 --> 23:31.785
You must remember this, Your Majesty.

23:38.385 --> 23:39.385
Cangcang,

23:40.865 --> 23:42.785
the one behind it all might really be her.

23:43.305 --> 23:44.905
But her roots in the palace run deep.

23:45.425 --> 23:48.945
If I move against her,
she'll strike back like mad.

23:50.185 --> 23:54.145
Only by sending you away safely
can I risk everything.

23:55.585 --> 23:56.625
I'm sorry.

24:17.545 --> 24:19.025
Your Majesty, Your Majesty the Empress,

24:19.545 --> 24:21.145
there's news from Physician Li.

24:22.065 --> 24:22.905
What news?

24:22.985 --> 24:26.425
The man at Fayun Temple
is already improving.

24:26.505 --> 24:28.505
He should wake up very soon.

24:29.865 --> 24:30.905
Really?

24:33.505 --> 24:34.785
That's wonderful!

24:40.665 --> 24:43.905
Ling Xuefeng is about to wake up.
You should be by his side.

24:45.825 --> 24:47.745
There's a thousand-year
lingzhi kept in the palace.

24:47.825 --> 24:48.945
It can strengthen one's vital energy.

24:49.545 --> 24:52.105
It's extremely effective for
patients who have just woken up.

24:52.185 --> 24:54.065
Have Wufu bring it when you go.

24:55.505 --> 24:57.145
Thank you, Your Majesty.
Then I'll go at once.

24:58.345 --> 24:59.185
Cangcang…

25:19.865 --> 25:22.225
What's wrong? Can't bear to leave me?

25:24.065 --> 25:26.105
Yeah. I can't.

25:28.825 --> 25:30.105
When I come back,

25:30.625 --> 25:32.625
will you still remember your vow?

25:37.025 --> 25:38.025
I will.

25:38.785 --> 25:39.785
Of course I will.

25:40.385 --> 25:43.065
Once we find the one behind it all,
you'd better keep your promise.

25:43.945 --> 25:45.225
All right.

25:45.305 --> 25:47.145
Then we'll leave the palace together,

25:47.225 --> 25:49.865
wandering around
and roaming the martial world again.

26:24.585 --> 26:27.825
Where did you get
this Golden Snake hairpin?

26:28.665 --> 26:30.025
It's something my mother left me.

26:33.025 --> 26:34.265
She said if I was ever in danger,

26:34.905 --> 26:36.785
I could use this hairpin to
seek help from the Lingbi Sect.

26:37.545 --> 26:39.465
The mighty Imperial Preceptor of Great Qi

26:39.545 --> 26:41.945
would turn to the Lingbi Sect?

26:42.825 --> 26:46.225
It seems your ambition is no small thing.

27:10.825 --> 27:13.505
We rely on
the support of all you stewards,

27:13.585 --> 27:16.985
so this is no more than you deserve.

27:25.705 --> 27:26.785
Ms. Yan,

27:27.305 --> 27:30.705
I'm old and plagued by illness.
I only wish to go home soon.

27:30.785 --> 27:33.265
Such generous gifts,
I'm really not worthy of them.

27:35.065 --> 27:36.305
Oh?

27:36.985 --> 27:38.385
Compared with all the bribes

27:38.465 --> 27:41.745
you've taken over the years,

27:41.825 --> 27:43.825
these hardly count as anything.

27:44.705 --> 27:48.305
Madam, Ms. Yan, I've been framed!

27:48.385 --> 27:49.865
I've been framed…

27:52.145 --> 27:55.305
Your crimes are
written out clearly right there.

28:07.345 --> 28:09.945
Did you really think your little schemes

28:10.025 --> 28:13.225
could ever fool the Madam?

28:14.945 --> 28:15.865
Guards!

28:16.545 --> 28:17.905
Spare me, Madam!

28:17.985 --> 28:19.065
Spare me, Madam!

28:20.145 --> 28:23.985
Du Tingxin, how dare you deal with
palace staff without permission?

28:24.065 --> 28:24.945
Du Tingxin!

28:25.745 --> 28:27.105
Du Tingxin!

28:32.305 --> 28:36.225
Anyone else here have something to say?

28:37.185 --> 28:38.665
From now on,

28:38.745 --> 28:41.105
we will follow only you, Madam!

28:41.185 --> 28:42.505
With absolute loyalty!

28:43.305 --> 28:45.745
-With absolute loyalty!
-With absolute loyalty!

28:49.825 --> 28:50.745
Eunuch Li…

28:57.305 --> 28:59.465
You've served in the palace a long time.

29:00.105 --> 29:02.585
Hearing that from you
puts my mind at ease.

29:04.785 --> 29:08.185
We've been short-handed
all over the palace lately.

29:08.705 --> 29:11.785
I've already chosen
new people to fill the gaps.

29:13.265 --> 29:17.385
Appoint them one by one
according to what's written there.

29:17.465 --> 29:18.625
Understood.

29:33.905 --> 29:35.665
Before long,

29:35.745 --> 29:39.745
Madam,
you'll have both the harem and the court

29:39.825 --> 29:41.065
in the palm of your hand.

29:51.665 --> 29:52.985
Ying, remember:

29:53.705 --> 29:55.265
After you and
your brother leave the palace,

29:55.345 --> 29:57.905
give this jade pendant to him.

29:58.665 --> 29:59.865
My brother's taking me out of the palace?

30:01.265 --> 30:02.425
That's right.

30:02.945 --> 30:05.545
I hope you can both stay safe.

30:06.305 --> 30:09.745
Leaving this place
may be the best choice for you.

30:11.545 --> 30:14.385
I just hope
all of this is just my suspicions.

30:15.705 --> 30:17.105
Suspicions?

30:18.625 --> 30:19.625
Suspicions about what?

30:21.345 --> 30:25.305
Whether someone who grew up with me

30:25.385 --> 30:26.505
is really the culprit.

30:28.985 --> 30:30.265
The culprit behind that medicinal incense?

30:34.225 --> 30:36.865
All right. Put this jade pendant away.

30:37.465 --> 30:39.745
Your brother isn't easy to handle.

30:40.505 --> 30:42.145
If I gave it to him myself,

30:42.225 --> 30:44.185
he'd pester me with a hundred questions.

30:44.265 --> 30:45.905
So I'm giving it to you instead.

30:45.985 --> 30:47.505
If you ever run into any danger,

30:48.025 --> 30:51.825
go to Fenglai Pavilion for money
or for people, as much as you like.

30:58.385 --> 30:59.505
Ying,

31:00.345 --> 31:02.865
everything that's happened
is already in the past.

31:03.705 --> 31:06.625
I hope you and your brother
can both find happiness.

31:17.345 --> 31:18.665
I'm sorry…

31:24.585 --> 31:26.105
I don't know why,

31:26.625 --> 31:28.625
but I suddenly wanted to say that to you.

31:32.545 --> 31:33.385
Ying,

31:34.425 --> 31:35.905
with your brother,

31:35.985 --> 31:38.225
hurry and leave this cold, lifeless place.

31:39.305 --> 31:43.185
I hope you will both be happy
and carefree.

31:44.345 --> 31:45.665
And you?

31:45.745 --> 31:46.985
Won't you cure me?

31:48.585 --> 31:51.225
It hurts you too much. Let's stop.

32:05.385 --> 32:06.825
Then what about Hongqing?

32:09.865 --> 32:11.745
I'm so close to remembering him.

32:18.185 --> 32:20.905
I want the treatment…
I want the treatment…

32:21.505 --> 32:22.865
I want to see Hongqing clearly!

32:22.945 --> 32:24.265
I want the treatment…

32:25.505 --> 32:26.865
I want the treatment!

32:26.945 --> 32:28.585
Treat me now!

32:37.985 --> 32:40.385
If you won't treat me, I'll treat myself!

32:52.185 --> 32:54.665
Xiao Ying, calm down!

32:54.745 --> 32:56.425
I want to see Hongqing clearly…

32:56.945 --> 32:59.065
I want to see Hongqing clearly!

32:59.145 --> 33:01.665
I want the treatment…

33:01.745 --> 33:03.625
I want to see Hongqing clearly…

33:03.705 --> 33:04.785
All right!

33:06.065 --> 33:07.305
I'll treat you.

33:39.905 --> 33:40.705
Stop!

33:41.465 --> 33:44.305
Your Majesty, how can you be so cruel?

33:45.185 --> 33:47.305
Please spare our Ying.
Are you trying to kill her?

33:49.145 --> 33:50.145
What are you talking about?

33:50.225 --> 33:51.705
I saw it with my own eyes.

33:52.985 --> 33:54.625
Stop torturing Ying.

33:55.945 --> 33:58.185
Your Majesty, I beg you.

33:59.265 --> 34:00.865
Please let Ying go.

34:00.945 --> 34:02.305
Take it out on me.

34:02.385 --> 34:04.185
Just stop tormenting her, please!

34:09.465 --> 34:11.505
Ying, we won't treat you anymore.

34:12.105 --> 34:13.344
You won't suffer like this anymore.

34:13.425 --> 34:15.705
Come on. Let me help you over.

34:16.385 --> 34:17.705
Let's go rest.

34:37.705 --> 34:38.625
Ying?

34:40.145 --> 34:41.824
-Ying?
-Mother…

34:41.905 --> 34:43.344
it hurts so much…

34:43.865 --> 34:45.744
What's wrong? Ying?

34:45.824 --> 34:46.985
It hurts…

34:48.385 --> 34:50.145
Ying, are you all right?

34:50.225 --> 34:51.105
Ying.

34:52.065 --> 34:53.465
Move aside! Don't touch her!

34:53.545 --> 34:55.264
Are you all right, Ying?

34:56.025 --> 34:56.865
Ying!

34:59.825 --> 35:00.825
Ying!

35:27.545 --> 35:28.585
Ying!

35:31.345 --> 35:32.505
-Ying!
-Ying!

35:32.585 --> 35:34.345
-Ying!
-Ying, wake up!

35:34.865 --> 35:35.705
Ying!

35:36.865 --> 35:39.265
Ying, please wake up! Ying!

35:39.345 --> 35:40.425
Ying!

35:46.305 --> 35:48.705
Ying! Ying!

35:51.665 --> 35:52.665
Ying!

35:58.945 --> 36:00.985
-Ying, wake up. Ying!
-Ying!

36:01.065 --> 36:02.105
Ying!

36:09.665 --> 36:10.705
Xiao Huan!

36:12.665 --> 36:14.945
You killed my dear Ying!

36:18.745 --> 36:19.825
Ying!

36:47.785 --> 36:52.025
SHUTONG HALL

37:05.505 --> 37:06.625
Ying.

37:09.905 --> 37:10.825
Ying.

37:12.825 --> 37:13.945
Wake up…

37:15.625 --> 37:17.705
It's… it's me.

37:20.265 --> 37:21.305
Ying.

37:24.945 --> 37:25.945
Look…

37:27.865 --> 37:29.345
the flowers are about to bloom.

37:31.265 --> 37:34.305
You said… they're called Blaze Blossom…

37:35.665 --> 37:37.505
and they're dazzling.

37:41.025 --> 37:42.785
You said when they bloomed,

37:43.545 --> 37:45.425
you, Zhong Lin, and I

37:46.905 --> 37:48.745
would return to Southern Chu.

37:48.825 --> 37:50.545
Do you still remember all that?

37:51.545 --> 37:56.145
I've already planned
to take you and Zhong Lin.

37:56.665 --> 37:58.625
We'll leave this place together,

38:00.105 --> 38:03.745
roam the martial world together,

38:04.545 --> 38:06.465
and go find your dear Hongqing together.

38:08.665 --> 38:10.585
We'll bring him along, all of us together.

38:13.625 --> 38:16.705
Didn't you say you missed him so much?

38:17.465 --> 38:18.905
Please wake up…

38:20.465 --> 38:22.465
Don't scare me like this…

38:24.385 --> 38:25.225
Ying.

38:25.305 --> 38:27.905
-Xiao Qianqing…
-I'm begging you, snap out of it.

38:27.985 --> 38:29.145
-Xiao Qianqing, wake up!
-I'm here…

38:29.225 --> 38:31.025
-Ying is dead!
-I'm here… Don't touch me!

38:35.585 --> 38:36.785
She's not dead…

38:38.145 --> 38:40.905
Ying loves studying
strange little medicines.

38:41.425 --> 38:44.545
This might…
might just be one she was trying out.

38:47.145 --> 38:48.905
She's tricking us.

38:49.425 --> 38:52.025
Ying… Ying is just playing a trick on us…

38:52.625 --> 38:54.625
-Xiao Qianqing!
-Ying…

38:54.705 --> 38:55.985
Wake up now!

38:56.065 --> 38:58.385
It was Xiao Huan who killed her!

39:34.145 --> 39:35.185
At last, I'm back.

39:35.265 --> 39:38.545
CHANGHE GATE

39:59.985 --> 40:02.065
Aren't you supposed to
be on duty at Wuying Hall?

40:02.145 --> 40:02.985
Why are you standing guard here?

40:10.345 --> 40:11.185
Your Highness?

40:12.345 --> 40:13.585
What happened?

40:14.665 --> 40:15.705
Where is the Princess?

40:44.705 --> 40:45.985
Where did you go?

40:47.745 --> 40:49.705
They all said you were dead.

40:49.785 --> 40:52.345
You should've stayed dead.
What did you come back for now?

41:43.585 --> 41:45.265
How could you die?

42:24.105 --> 42:25.385
So, Princess Ying…

42:28.265 --> 42:30.745
died to force out the Dual-Pupil insect.

42:31.705 --> 42:33.065
To get her memories back,

42:33.585 --> 42:36.425
she suffered pain no
ordinary person could bear.

42:42.665 --> 42:44.585
I promised Princess Ying

42:48.065 --> 42:50.025
I'd protect her for life…

42:56.425 --> 42:58.665
You're both such hopeless fools.

43:08.105 --> 43:09.065
Get out.

43:09.585 --> 43:11.025
Get out of my sight!

43:25.825 --> 43:26.705
Put her down.

43:28.825 --> 43:29.945
What, do you think

43:30.905 --> 43:33.145
I'm the sort who fears death?
